Package: nearby
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: subnetsmith <291419189+subnetsmith@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, sudo
Recommends: alsa-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/subnetsmith/cardputer-nearby
Description: Beep when another CardputerZero running nearby is close
 Each device sends a small anonymous Bluetooth LE beacon and listens for the
 others, then beeps and shows roughly how close they are. Only devices running
 nearby can see each other. The beacon address changes every 15 minutes.
